ABRL local harness helper

positional arguments:
  {init,new-task,conversion-window,agent-brief,trial-log,trial-summary,harness-compare,agent-note,reference-index,list-literature,list-papers,list-mathlib,list-scenarios,list-weapons,list-lean-decls,search-memory,list-routes,route-plan,screen-plan,render-roadmap-assets,blueprint-refresh,memory-refresh,frontier-shadow,frontier-replay,frontier-refresh,memory-record,memory-packet,retrieval-record,statement-fence,safe-verify,frontier-dispatch,lifecycle-event,export-proof,run-cycle,sleep-run,unfinished,review-prompt,extended-pro-prompt,review-status,review-response-template,extended-pro-response-template,review-handoff,extended-pro-handoff,review-record-response,extended-pro-record-response,check,next-task}
    init                initialize work directories
    new-task            create task, conversion window, and proof ledger
    conversion-window   create a conversion window
    agent-brief         create an agent brief
    trial-log           append a trial record
    trial-summary       rewrite trial summary CSV
    harness-compare     compare matched hierarchical and master-worker trial
                        evidence
    agent-note          append a role note to run dialogue
    reference-index     refresh LML, Mathlib, textbook, paper, scenario,
                        weapon, and local Lean indexes
    list-literature     list built-in theorem cards
    list-papers         list bandit paper and survey cards
    list-mathlib        list Mathlib retrieval cards
    list-scenarios      list bandit scenario cards
    list-weapons        list proof weapon inspiration cards
    list-lean-decls     list local Lean declarations
    search-memory       search theorem, Mathlib, textbook, paper, scenario,
                        weapon, route, spine, local leaf, and Lean declaration
                        cards
    list-routes         list structured theorem-route roadmaps
    route-plan          print one structured theorem-route plan
    screen-plan         print a screen/codex execution plan for a task and
                        optional route
    render-roadmap-assets
                        render structured Lean route roadmap PNG diagrams
    blueprint-refresh   refresh proof blueprint snapshot
    memory-refresh      refresh retrieval memory
    frontier-shadow     read-only reconstruction of trials, memory, and active
                        frontier
    frontier-replay     shadow replay historical task transitions with bounded
                        memory
    frontier-refresh    write the authoritative active-frontier record after
                        shadow review
    memory-record       append one validated typed lifecycle-memory record
    memory-packet       render bounded task- and role-scoped lifecycle memory
    retrieval-record    record local-first theorem/API retrieval evidence
    statement-fence     capture an immutable Lean declaration header
    safe-verify         check a declaration fence and forbidden Lean
                        placeholders
    frontier-dispatch   dispatch one ready DAG leaf after the shadow gate
    lifecycle-event     append one stable session-tree or directive event
    export-proof        create Markdown and LaTeX proof export skeletons
    run-cycle           create or execute one evidence-tracked prompt deck
    sleep-run           create or execute repeated evidence-tracked cycles
    unfinished          list unfinished proof leaves and backlog rows
    review-prompt       print the current local review prompt
    extended-pro-prompt
                        print a legacy Extended Pro review prompt
    review-status       print the current review boundary status
    review-response-template
                        print the current local review response template
    extended-pro-response-template
                        print a legacy Extended Pro response template
    review-handoff      print the current local review handoff packet
    extended-pro-handoff
                        print a legacy manual Extended Pro handoff packet
    review-record-response
                        record a completed local review response artifact
    extended-pro-record-response
                        record a completed legacy Extended Pro response
                        artifact
    check               run Lean build gate and placeholder scan
    next-task           list known tasks

